ap!\nAvoid the opponents' collision, THROW water balloons, and drop the opponents into the FALLING TILES!", "short_description": "Drive to BUMP\n1. Seize the steering wheel.\n2. Rev up your Bumpy.\n3. BUMP!\n\nWelcome to BumpyR, a casual social VR game where your meta avatar drives a bumper car! Though it is a car game, all you have to do is BUMP, not drive!\n\nBUMP and CRASH with up to 6 players and DooDoos located all over the map!\nAvoid the opponents' collision, THROW water balloons, and drop the opponents into the FALLING TILES!"}]}, "developer_name": "KapeHorn", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://bumpyr-privacy-policy.oopy.io/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "KapeHorn", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://kapehorn.notion.site/Welcome-to-KAPE-HORN-e053582d352a47539058c510c939ca74", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "NOT_RATED", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "673385183287495"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "235904705501035"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 6, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "3627814770850799"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "627826883081546"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1652592835343364"}, {"status": "CANCELLED", "id": "1500428827291264"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1304854300831542"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "247407824917482"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "3627814770850799"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1741154040, 